# This directory holds ~45 GB of FITS and PypeIt output alongside the pipeline,
# so the rule is an allowlist: ignore everything, then name what belongs in the
# repo.  A blocklist here would be one forgotten pattern away from staging 39 GB.

/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/requirements.txt
!/kcwi_stds_selected.txt
!/*.py

# std_red_matched.csv is the table both analyze_gratings.py and
# download_std_red.py read, so a fresh clone is usable without a KOA query.  The
# other tables are per-run artifacts and the caliblists are a fetch cache.
!/outputKC/
outputKC/*
!outputKC/std_red_matched.csv

# Never: the KOA login cookie is a credential.
koa_cookie.txt

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
